    "name": "spartan",
    "descriptionZh": "spartan 是给 Angular 用的无障碍 UI 原语，基于 signals，SSR 兼容、zoneless ready。它的做法是行为层装包、样式自己拷进项目改。",
    "descriptionEn": null,
    "takeawayZh": "装 spartan 行为层，把样式拷进 Angular 项目自己改。",
    "noteZh": "首屏正中一句话很直白：Stop fighting your component library.，副标题写 Accessible UI primitives for Angular - built with signals, SSR compatible, zoneless ready. Install the behavior. Copy the styles. Customize without limits.，下面三颗按钮是 Get Started、View Components、Star on GitHub。再往下换到 Examples 一排标签，Dashboard、Tasks、Playground、Authentication 横排，展示区里铺开 Payment Method 卡片、Two-factor authentication 卡片、Compute Environment 里的 Kubernetes 与 Virtual Machine 选项。",
